+<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Visit-end event queue</title><script>document.documentElement.classList.add('js')</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head><body><main id="top"><h1>Visit-end event delivery</h1><p>Only synthetic events are recorded in this local fixture. Events stay queued while this page is visible and are sent to /events when you leave the page.</p><button id="record-event" type="button" disabled>Record sample event</button><p id="event-status" role="status">Ready to queue a synthetic event.</p><noscript><p>JavaScript is required to queue synthetic events.</p></noscript></main><script>window.fixtureState={deletions:0,subscriptions:[]};window.removeSavedReport=()=>{window.fixtureState.deletions++;document.querySelector('#saved-report').hidden=true};window.acceptSubscription=email=>{window.fixtureState.subscriptions.push(email);return 'Request accepted. Check your inbox.'};</script><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>
